# Discarding to Dream Trawler gives it hexproof and taps it until it untaps normally (CR 701.26a, 702.11b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Dream Trawler
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus#1.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Dream Trawler.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Trawler.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Trawler.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Trawler.Keywords = Flying; Hexproof; Lifelink
